# Put the interfaces in their zones (this changes traffic at once):
#   zone FWS_InternalZone: no interface is known
#   zone FWS_ExternalZone: no interface is known
# Written inactive:
#   Social: references 'Facebook': object of type 'application-site'
#   Admins: references 'netadmins': access role whose networks and users are not in the export (add the output of 'show access-roles details-level full')
#   PLC access (plc-operators): source user match ad_group_PLC-Operators is not converted
#   PLC access (vendor-support): source user match ad_group_Vendor-Support is not converted
#   DMZ users: source user match known-user is not converted
#   Updates: schedule 'Work-Hours' is not converted; the rule would apply at all times; host name object .updates.example.com: the form of an address object of a host name is not in the documentation FWShift could read
#   Old rule: references 'lan-without-guests': object of type 'group-with-exclusion'
#   Partners: not converted: VPN community match Partner-VPN
